{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>北角有住宅大廈單位起火，無人受傷。</p><p></p><p>火警後，起火單位部分玻璃窗碎裂，只剩下窗框。大批消防員到場灌救，有婆婆需要警員協助疏散。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.FIRE.NP-1630_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20263EF6xz4GCI1794821815.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>現場是春秧街55至71號宜安大廈，警方下午近3時半，接獲單位事主報案，指其位於低層的單位發生火警，事主與家人和其他居民自行疏散到安全地方。初步調查相信，單位內有電腦插蘇懷疑因過熱起火。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.FIRE.NP-1630.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026WJzqg1Eq9E1794821851.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T10:16:31.650049+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T09:23:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T01:59:50.282378+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T10:09:41.689791+00:00","content_hash":"a1cb138af2b3850698d5973b4257c435ff9145ec65964f6322ebb59fe3ef3417","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T10:16:31.650049+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}